  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">English Language Training for Officials 2024 ASEAN Symposium</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Activity will fund&#xA0;a symposium in Q1 2024 for 64 participants in Thailand, including all participants from ELTO 55 and 56.&#xA0;The participants will set their own symposium programme and put together their own presentations, linked to the theme of their ELTO, work placements and substantive roles. There will also be guest speakers.</narrative>
  </description>
